<h3>2026-09-25 — OpenRouter live remaining on /ai/usage</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> Usage overview shows OpenRouter remaining from the existing <code>GET openrouter.ai/api/v1/auth/key</code> call (<code>Model::AI::Usage::fetch_openrouter_status</code>, already run on page load for admins). SuperGrok card shows Hermes xai-oauth tokens this UTC week only — xAI does not publish the grok.com weekly %.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> OpenRouter is a prepaid balance we can poll. SuperGrok is a subscription pool with no API.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>root/ai/usage.tt</code>, <code>root/static/js/ai/usage-monitor.js</code>, <code>Model/AI2/UsageMonitor.pm</code></p>
